# Optional: the API base defaults to the Fly app in production builds and to
# http://localhost:8787 under `pnpm dev` (see nuxt.config.ts). Set this only to
# point a build somewhere else. It's a build-time variable, not a secret: it
# ends up in the client bundle.
NUXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE=https://compressor-tool-aged-field-3599.fly.dev

# Optional: where the landing page's "vanishing act" card points. Defaults to
# https://file.jok3r.win, the file transfer tool's Worker.
# NUXT_PUBLIC_TRANSFER_URL=https://file.jok3r.win
